1
00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:01,540
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,541 --> 00:00:03,041
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,375 --> 00:00:04,540
(Episode 87)

4
00:00:04,541 --> 00:00:07,458
Her abdominal injury caused
severe internal bleeding,

5
00:00:07,641 --> 00:00:10,233
and she miscarried during surgery.

6
00:00:23,310 --> 00:00:24,820
Why are you like this?

7
00:00:26,241 --> 00:00:27,546
Has everyone left?

8
00:00:28,041 --> 00:00:29,041
Not yet.

9
00:00:29,309 --> 00:00:30,458
Why? Should I tell them to go?

10
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:34,181
No. What right do I have to ask?

11
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:39,528
What do you mean, what right?

12
00:00:40,071 --> 00:00:41,914
They're here because they care about you.

13
00:00:42,708 --> 00:00:43,750
I know.

14
00:00:47,041 --> 00:00:48,798
You must've been so shocked.

15
00:00:50,250 --> 00:00:51,500
I was.

16
00:00:52,706 --> 00:00:56,757
I didn't even know you were pregnant,
then they said you'd miscarried.

17
00:00:57,925 --> 00:01:01,627
At first, I wondered
if the doctor was mistaken.

18
00:01:03,626 --> 00:01:04,710
I'm sorry.

19
00:01:06,144 --> 00:01:08,472
I planned to tell you in a few days,
once I'd made sure.

20
00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:11,297
I just need you to be safe.

21
00:01:12,631 --> 00:01:16,330
I'm more upset that you went
somewhere so dangerous alone.

22
00:01:16,513 --> 00:01:17,600
You could've told me.

23
00:01:18,583 --> 00:01:20,298
If you'd been hurt any worse, I...

24
00:01:20,583 --> 00:01:23,208
I wasn't thinking straight. You know that.

25
00:01:27,293 --> 00:01:28,627
Are you craving anything?

26
00:01:29,105 --> 00:01:30,543
Should I pick up some dinner?

27
00:01:31,583 --> 00:01:33,625
I'm okay. Don't worry about me.

28
00:01:34,289 --> 00:01:35,914
Take care of your mom and dad.

29
00:01:35,916 --> 00:01:38,000
- Ji Ni.
- I mean it.

30
00:01:38,416 --> 00:01:42,125
I don't feel any different.
It's just another day.

31
00:01:44,438 --> 00:01:45,594
Don't worry.

32
00:01:46,063 --> 00:01:50,188
I suspected I was pregnant,
but I wasn't even sure there was a baby.

33
00:01:51,166 --> 00:01:55,293
No, it was too early to call it a baby.

34
00:01:55,958 --> 00:01:57,625
So don't worry about me.

35
00:01:59,208 --> 00:02:00,791
You should sleep at home tonight.

36
00:02:23,380 --> 00:02:24,495
Stay lying down.

37
00:02:24,581 --> 00:02:26,131
You shouldn't sit up so suddenly.

38
00:02:26,583 --> 00:02:27,819
Is your abdominal binder on properly?

39
00:02:28,083 --> 00:02:29,125
Yes.

40
00:02:31,208 --> 00:02:32,375
I'm sorry.

41
00:02:32,416 --> 00:02:33,674
Don't say that.

42
00:02:33,675 --> 00:02:35,486
Why apologize? It's not your fault.

43
00:02:36,500 --> 00:02:39,091
I heard you lent my mom money.

44
00:02:39,375 --> 00:02:41,166
I'm so ashamed, Father.

45
00:02:41,208 --> 00:02:43,833
She's family too.
I should help her if I can.

46
00:02:44,672 --> 00:02:46,418
For now, you should focus on recovering.

47
00:02:48,333 --> 00:02:50,000
I don't know what to say.

48
00:02:50,625 --> 00:02:54,041
I wanted to share the good news with you
once I'd confirmed it,

49
00:02:54,797 --> 00:02:56,922
but I was too careless.

50
00:02:57,333 --> 00:02:58,750
I'm sorry.

51
00:03:00,819 --> 00:03:03,075
Your health comes first.
We can talk about that later.

52
00:03:03,076 --> 00:03:04,194
Let's focus on getting you better.

53
00:03:04,322 --> 00:03:05,500
Don't worry about anything.

54
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,541
I'm really blessed
to have good fathers in my life.

55
00:03:12,583 --> 00:03:13,625
Really?

56
00:03:14,875 --> 00:03:16,375
I'm happy to hear that.

57
00:03:20,833 --> 00:03:21,958
Ma'am.

58
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:25,666
Keep your voice down.

59
00:03:28,250 --> 00:03:30,415
I won't have time to see you later.

60
00:03:30,625 --> 00:03:33,073
You need to start taking action.

61
00:03:33,691 --> 00:03:34,691
What?

62
00:03:34,875 --> 00:03:37,382
What choice do we have
now that it's come to this?

63
00:03:37,555 --> 00:03:38,708
You heard it too.

64
00:03:39,698 --> 00:03:43,176
Ji Ni's abdominal injury
damaged her uterus too.

65
00:03:43,416 --> 00:03:45,244
She can never get pregnant again.

66
00:03:45,246 --> 00:03:47,514
And if she does, she'll miscarry again.

67
00:03:47,583 --> 00:03:49,000
Why would you say something like...

68
00:03:50,073 --> 00:03:51,259
You're scaring me.

69
00:03:51,375 --> 00:03:54,416
Ji Hu wanted a child of his own so badly.

70
00:03:56,791 --> 00:04:00,291
Knowing him, he won't be able
to leave Ji Ni,

71
00:04:00,833 --> 00:04:03,333
and she got stabbed because of her mom.

72
00:04:04,477 --> 00:04:07,454
All three families are facing
nothing but sorrow.

73
00:04:07,875 --> 00:04:10,000
I know. What can we do?

74
00:04:10,958 --> 00:04:13,375
Stop getting so sentimental.

75
00:04:14,958 --> 00:04:16,583
Are you really going
to take this all the way?

76
00:04:16,625 --> 00:04:17,750
Look at this girl.

77
00:04:18,585 --> 00:04:21,751
Do you think a woman my age
would waste time joking with you?

78
00:04:22,089 --> 00:04:23,089
Hey...

79
00:04:23,193 --> 00:04:25,984
Do you think I have no other women
to introduce to Ji Hu?

80
00:04:27,444 --> 00:04:29,692
I'm giving you a chance.

81
00:04:30,094 --> 00:04:31,372
Are you taking it or not?

82
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:33,041
Pull yourself together.

83
00:04:34,041 --> 00:04:35,916
But Ji Ni is suffering so much...

84
00:04:35,967 --> 00:04:40,134
If she had any sense,
she'd pack up and leave right now.

85
00:04:41,375 --> 00:04:43,208
Who is she to think she can stay?

86
00:04:43,541 --> 00:04:45,875
If she weren't involved with Ji Hu,

87
00:04:46,625 --> 00:04:49,916
I could at least feel sorry for her.

88
00:04:49,958 --> 00:04:53,750
But now our family's survival
is on the line.

89
00:04:54,944 --> 00:04:57,611
Do you know how much
your father-in-law loves children?

90
00:04:59,041 --> 00:05:00,533
I only managed to have one...

91
00:05:02,125 --> 00:05:05,015
Anyway, here's my card.

92
00:05:05,875 --> 00:05:07,333
Go make yourself look prettier.

93
00:05:08,833 --> 00:05:10,368
- Sorry?
- "Sorry?"

94
00:05:11,333 --> 00:05:13,291
You're so clueless.

95
00:05:14,261 --> 00:05:18,956
Ji Hu likes women who look
as sweet and innocent as Ji Ni,

96
00:05:18,958 --> 00:05:22,250
so have your hair styled
to look more feminine,

97
00:05:22,906 --> 00:05:25,076
and buy yourself some stylish clothes.

98
00:05:25,317 --> 00:05:27,650
Your goal is Ji Hu. Got it?

99
00:05:27,958 --> 00:05:30,000
After the wedding, do whatever you want.

100
00:05:31,009 --> 00:05:33,297
I'll introduce you to a makeup artist,

101
00:05:33,404 --> 00:05:35,051
so get your makeup done properly.

102
00:05:37,333 --> 00:05:38,936
What was art school for?

103
00:05:39,217 --> 00:05:41,679
Try painting your own face better first.

104
00:05:41,815 --> 00:05:42,815
Okay?

105
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:46,437
Let's go, Jung A.

106
00:05:46,666 --> 00:05:48,086
- Okay.
- Ma'am.

107
00:05:48,390 --> 00:05:49,999
We'll get going now too.

108
00:05:50,000 --> 00:05:52,136
Okay. Thank you for today.

109
00:05:52,416 --> 00:05:54,708
Let me say goodbye to Ji Ni first.

110
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:00,500
Hey.

111
00:06:01,914 --> 00:06:03,539
Has she never dated anyone?

112
00:06:03,541 --> 00:06:06,482
She says it's because
her standards are too high.

113
00:06:06,666 --> 00:06:09,875
But why do you ask?
Are you setting her up with someone?

114
00:06:11,458 --> 00:06:13,083
Ma'am, set me up too.

115
00:06:13,125 --> 00:06:15,239
You...

116
00:06:15,554 --> 00:06:18,190
With your looks and family background,
why are you still single?

117
00:06:18,666 --> 00:06:20,875
You only have yourself to blame.

118
00:06:22,875 --> 00:06:23,875
Yes.

119
00:06:25,307 --> 00:06:26,414
Are you okay?

120
00:06:27,458 --> 00:06:30,649
I'm okay.
You expected me to be crying, right?

121
00:06:31,333 --> 00:06:33,125
Honestly, I did.

122
00:06:34,625 --> 00:06:36,211
Do I even have the right to cry?

123
00:06:37,208 --> 00:06:41,416
This happened because of me.
They'd hate me even more if I cried.

124
00:06:41,933 --> 00:06:42,961
Na Ji Ni.

125
00:06:42,963 --> 00:06:45,963
If I'd never been born,
none of this would be happening.

126
00:06:46,416 --> 00:06:49,916
Yeong Ju, Seung Woo's leg, Ji Hu...
They'd all be fine.

127
00:06:51,585 --> 00:06:53,501
So what do you want to do?

128
00:06:56,445 --> 00:06:57,987
There's nothing I can do.

129
00:06:59,967 --> 00:07:03,461
I can't even have children.
Am I just a burden to Ji Hu?

130
00:07:04,708 --> 00:07:06,452
- Ji Ni.
- I know.

131
00:07:07,041 --> 00:07:09,708
I know what you're going to say.

132
00:07:11,134 --> 00:07:13,818
Thank you. You're all I have.

133
00:07:14,833 --> 00:07:15,833
Me?

134
00:07:16,166 --> 00:07:20,458
You support me without wanting
or expecting anything from me.

135
00:07:22,557 --> 00:07:24,307
Of course.

136
00:07:25,625 --> 00:07:26,934
I'll come again tomorrow.

137
00:07:27,491 --> 00:07:29,325
No, I'm being discharged.

138
00:07:30,041 --> 00:07:31,997
Come visit me at home sometime.

139
00:07:38,583 --> 00:07:40,000
There's no one like you, Jung A.

140
00:07:40,723 --> 00:07:42,682
You even got Ji Ni to smile.

141
00:07:44,662 --> 00:07:46,188
What about you? Are you okay?

142
00:07:46,416 --> 00:07:47,458
Of course.

143
00:07:58,848 --> 00:07:59,890
I'll get going.

144
00:08:13,208 --> 00:08:14,358
Wouldn't Ji Ni...

145
00:08:15,083 --> 00:08:17,815
be happy if someone rescued her
from this situation?

146
00:08:19,250 --> 00:08:21,000
Probably Ji Hu too.

147
00:08:21,125 --> 00:08:23,635
You're right. They must both be suffering.

148
00:08:24,373 --> 00:08:26,529
If someone stepped in and ended it,

149
00:08:26,854 --> 00:08:28,689
would they both feel relieved and free?

150
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,263
What are you saying?
How can they cut ties?

151
00:08:35,916 --> 00:08:39,958
Even if I had a time machine,
I wouldn't know where to go.

152
00:08:40,307 --> 00:08:42,390
Going back to before Ji Ni was born
wouldn't work.

153
00:08:43,125 --> 00:08:46,083
Maybe right before she went
to that bastard's place?

154
00:08:46,541 --> 00:08:48,497
But that wouldn't change anything.

155
00:08:49,666 --> 00:08:53,250
What about before Ji Ni's mom
hit Director Cha with her car?

156
00:08:54,125 --> 00:08:55,450
Would that be better?

157
00:08:55,833 --> 00:08:57,805
Yeah, that might actually work.

158
00:08:58,064 --> 00:08:59,377
Do you have a time machine?

159
00:09:00,625 --> 00:09:04,291
You have a time machine
and you still make me worry like this?

160
00:09:04,458 --> 00:09:05,458
No.

161
00:09:07,750 --> 00:09:10,124
I'm heading out. Make sure you lock up.

162
00:09:11,166 --> 00:09:12,166
Okay.

163
00:09:30,235 --> 00:09:34,360
Jeon Jung A,
are you really going to do this?

164
00:09:43,592 --> 00:09:46,967
Really? Joong Bin is going to help?

165
00:09:47,428 --> 00:09:48,428
Yeah.

166
00:09:49,166 --> 00:09:51,321
He knows a lot of people.

167
00:09:52,500 --> 00:09:54,336
But things have changed these days.

168
00:09:54,528 --> 00:09:57,291
Even people in high positions
can't just do whatever they want.

169
00:09:57,960 --> 00:09:59,061
So, I guess...

170
00:09:59,234 --> 00:10:02,500
he might be able to speed things up
a little. That's about it.

171
00:10:02,541 --> 00:10:05,333
That's still something.
I'm going crazy waiting around.

172
00:10:06,765 --> 00:10:09,375
He's prepared to face assault charges.

173
00:10:09,607 --> 00:10:11,941
But he didn't set the fire or kill anyone.

174
00:10:12,717 --> 00:10:15,030
If they can just prove that,
we'll be grateful.

175
00:10:16,163 --> 00:10:20,448
They also need proof
that he didn't break that guy's leg.

176
00:10:20,550 --> 00:10:22,924
If his leg was really injured,
he can't get out even if he wants to.

177
00:10:23,583 --> 00:10:26,953
Didn't he say in the initial statement
that he went there to break his leg?

178
00:10:27,541 --> 00:10:28,541
Yeah.

179
00:10:28,666 --> 00:10:31,041
It all depends on how the judge sees it.

180
00:10:32,913 --> 00:10:36,288
They should take 25 years of injustice
into account.

181
00:10:39,275 --> 00:10:41,025
Are you staying here?

182
00:10:42,666 --> 00:10:44,976
Until Seung Hyun's situation is resolved.

183
00:10:44,977 --> 00:10:46,375
Seung Woo's on his own too.

184
00:10:47,083 --> 00:10:48,125
Why?

185
00:10:52,500 --> 00:10:54,375
Na Ji Ni is being discharged today.

186
00:10:57,733 --> 00:11:00,192
How am I supposed to face her?

187
00:11:00,708 --> 00:11:03,196
Why did you send her
somewhere so dangerous?

188
00:11:04,791 --> 00:11:07,833
All I could think about
was getting revenge on Na Se Ri.

189
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:11,666
I'm such an idiot.

190
00:11:12,791 --> 00:11:13,916
Ji Ni...

191
00:11:16,828 --> 00:11:18,120
had a miscarriage.

192
00:11:19,807 --> 00:11:22,432
What? A miscarriage?

193
00:11:24,889 --> 00:11:26,139
So she was pregnant.

194
00:11:27,708 --> 00:11:30,500
Her uterus was damaged, so she may have
trouble getting pregnant again.

195
00:11:31,537 --> 00:11:33,537
I don't even know if she knows that yet.

196
00:11:34,833 --> 00:11:36,666
The General is really worried about her.

197
00:11:38,996 --> 00:11:40,079
My goodness!

198
00:11:50,083 --> 00:11:51,083
Let's go.

199
00:11:55,130 --> 00:11:58,005
Did you tell Mom about my miscarriage?

200
00:11:58,791 --> 00:12:00,583
Yeah.

201
00:12:01,666 --> 00:12:04,375
She called to say she'd come this morning,
so I explained everything.

202
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,416
I need to see her.

203
00:12:06,458 --> 00:12:07,458
Now?

204
00:12:08,030 --> 00:12:11,072
You're still not well,
and she's very upset too.

205
00:12:11,208 --> 00:12:13,041
- Maybe wait until later...
- Are you afraid I'll lose my temper?

206
00:12:14,414 --> 00:12:15,414
Yeah.

207
00:12:15,416 --> 00:12:17,041
You still don't know me.

208
00:12:17,729 --> 00:12:18,770
Don't worry.

209
00:12:23,848 --> 00:12:25,307
I'll see her alone.

210
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:28,999
You can go straight home,
or come with me, but don't come inside.

211
00:12:29,457 --> 00:12:30,457
Okay?

212
00:12:45,666 --> 00:12:48,166
Ji Ni.

213
00:12:50,250 --> 00:12:53,083
How are you feeling? Does anything hurt?
Are you okay?

214
00:12:54,500 --> 00:12:56,750
Yeah. Sit down.

215
00:12:57,041 --> 00:12:59,083
You're still having a hard time,
aren't you?

216
00:13:01,083 --> 00:13:04,208
You didn't have to come all this way.
I would've come to you.

217
00:13:04,954 --> 00:13:07,749
Stay with me tonight.
Have you had any seaweed soup?

218
00:13:08,208 --> 00:13:10,458
Come on. Let's go get some.

219
00:13:10,500 --> 00:13:12,458
Did you eat seaweed soup
after giving birth to me too?

220
00:13:13,083 --> 00:13:14,625
After ruining someone else's life?

221
00:13:16,136 --> 00:13:17,136
What?

222
00:13:19,041 --> 00:13:21,602
Tell me the truth.
I want to know for sure.

223
00:13:22,750 --> 00:13:23,750
Did...

224
00:13:25,441 --> 00:13:27,649
you really pay him to hide?

225
00:13:28,656 --> 00:13:30,857
Was it to make Yeong Ju
and Grandpa suffer,

226
00:13:31,383 --> 00:13:33,125
because she wouldn't divorce Dad?

227
00:13:33,823 --> 00:13:35,873
When I brought you the Pumseonggak photos,

228
00:13:35,875 --> 00:13:38,390
and asked you to explain
something so obvious,

229
00:13:38,391 --> 00:13:39,678
did you lie to my face?

230
00:13:43,098 --> 00:13:44,390
Answer me!

231
00:13:44,486 --> 00:13:47,022
Ji Ni, are you okay?

232
00:13:47,261 --> 00:13:48,327
Ji Ni.

233
00:13:49,500 --> 00:13:50,708
Answer me first.

234
00:13:52,041 --> 00:13:54,911
Yeah, I did. That's exactly what I did.

235
00:13:55,166 --> 00:13:56,446
Why ask when you already know?

236
00:13:56,774 --> 00:13:59,024
At first, I begged them to forgive me.
I felt terrible.

237
00:13:59,375 --> 00:14:01,621
But people should know when to stop.

238
00:14:01,622 --> 00:14:03,916
How long was I supposed to put up with it?

239
00:14:05,250 --> 00:14:07,166
I'm not saying I was right.

240
00:14:07,505 --> 00:14:09,956
Just because your dad acknowledged her
before he died,

241
00:14:09,957 --> 00:14:11,463
she showed up and insisted on being
the chief mourner at his funeral,

242
00:14:11,583 --> 00:14:14,213
and even took bone marrow
for her own grandson.

243
00:14:14,666 --> 00:14:16,875
Yeong Ju wasn't innocent either, was she?

244
00:14:16,958 --> 00:14:18,250
She apologized.

245
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:19,791
She said she was sorry to me.

246
00:14:19,833 --> 00:14:21,643
- I apologized too.
- No.

247
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:23,666
You only did it to save yourself.

248
00:14:24,095 --> 00:14:25,144
You were so caught up
in your own twisted logic...

249
00:14:25,165 --> 00:14:28,221
that you ignored even the basic decency
people should show each other.

250
00:14:28,308 --> 00:14:30,291
But I'm still your mom.

251
00:14:30,874 --> 00:14:34,057
I've spent my whole life
fighting to protect you.

252
00:14:34,059 --> 00:14:36,500
And this is how you repay me?

253
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:40,597
Even though I'm stuck in this filthy,
stinking motel room...

254
00:14:40,666 --> 00:14:41,892
Do you expect me to appreciate that?

255
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:44,989
You're the reason I was born
and spent my life being judged.

256
00:14:45,344 --> 00:14:47,677
You're also the one who recklessly
blew through Dad's inheritance.

257
00:14:48,111 --> 00:14:50,749
You brought all of this on yourself.

258
00:14:51,531 --> 00:14:53,082
- Na Ji Ni.
- That's right.

259
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,557
I'll be Na Ji Ni until the day I die.

260
00:14:55,992 --> 00:14:57,451
That's why I feel so hopeless.

261
00:14:58,791 --> 00:15:00,590
They say I might never be able
to have children.

262
00:15:00,591 --> 00:15:02,791
I don't even know if I should stay
with Ji Hu anymore.

263
00:15:02,916 --> 00:15:04,629
No. You can't do that.

264
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:07,333
You need to hold on to him now
more than ever!

265
00:15:08,583 --> 00:15:10,868
You only ever think
about what you want and need.

266
00:15:11,419 --> 00:15:13,079
Dad was the man you wanted,

267
00:15:13,333 --> 00:15:17,130
so you had to have him,
even though he was married. How selfish!

268
00:15:17,665 --> 00:15:18,825
I despise you for it.

269
00:15:20,536 --> 00:15:21,585
Good for you.

270
00:15:22,216 --> 00:15:24,313
So what? What do you want from me?

271
00:15:25,125 --> 00:15:27,027
You look like you've made up your mind.
Spit it out.

272
00:15:47,250 --> 00:15:48,704
I'm done with you, Mom.

273
00:15:48,789 --> 00:15:50,416
I can't keep letting this slide.

274
00:15:52,283 --> 00:15:53,283
Ji Ni.

275
00:15:53,291 --> 00:15:56,790
Just like Cha Seung Woo said,
I should've died in your womb.

276
00:15:57,365 --> 00:15:59,009
Just like the baby I lost yesterday.

277
00:16:01,519 --> 00:16:05,810
Ji Ni, I know you're angry,
but you can't say things like that.

278
00:16:06,121 --> 00:16:08,371
Don't you care how I felt
when I almost lost you?

279
00:16:08,958 --> 00:16:11,041
You're still recovering. Maybe later...

280
00:16:11,083 --> 00:16:13,514
I'm barely holding myself together.
I can't worry about your feelings, too.

281
00:16:14,666 --> 00:16:16,500
I came here to end this for good.

282
00:16:18,111 --> 00:16:19,716
We'll never see each other again.

283
00:16:19,859 --> 00:16:22,496
So accept that you have no daughter
and grow old alone.

284
00:16:23,916 --> 00:16:25,482
Don't ever try to see me again.

285
00:16:26,208 --> 00:16:27,833
Ji Ni, wait!

286
00:16:29,083 --> 00:16:31,145
Ji Ni, do you really mean that?

287
00:16:32,041 --> 00:16:33,515
Are you really never going
to see me again?

288
00:16:34,666 --> 00:16:37,100
You don't mean that, do you?

289
00:16:37,101 --> 00:16:39,220
You're just saying that
because you're angry, right?

290
00:16:43,349 --> 00:16:44,587
Ji Ni.

291
00:16:45,901 --> 00:16:46,901
Ji Ni!

292
00:16:53,528 --> 00:16:57,319
Ji Ni!

293
00:17:03,140 --> 00:17:04,182
Go.

294
00:17:05,791 --> 00:17:08,305
Ji Ni!

295
00:17:08,810 --> 00:17:11,875
Ji Ni!

296
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:17,250
- Let's go, or I'm getting out.
- Ji Ni.

297
00:17:18,333 --> 00:17:21,875
Ji Ni, please don't abandon me!

298
00:17:22,291 --> 00:17:27,708
Ji Ni, you can't abandon me.

299
00:17:30,500 --> 00:17:37,166
No! Ji Ni, you can't abandon me!

300
00:17:37,375 --> 00:17:43,625
No, Ji Ni!

301
00:17:51,917 --> 00:17:54,993
Ji Ni!

302
00:17:55,347 --> 00:17:58,125
You can't abandon me, Ji Ni...

303
00:18:13,486 --> 00:18:14,486
What?

304
00:18:16,328 --> 00:18:18,328
This is so touching, Father.

305
00:18:18,333 --> 00:18:21,416
Is it? Just wait till you taste it.

306
00:18:23,291 --> 00:18:25,698
That's right. Give it a try.

307
00:18:38,583 --> 00:18:40,458
It's really delicious, Father.

308
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,493
Good. I'm glad.

309
00:18:42,837 --> 00:18:43,916
Have some more.

310
00:18:44,375 --> 00:18:46,541
Eat up, get your strength back,
and recover.

311
00:18:47,375 --> 00:18:48,393
Okay.

312
00:18:55,942 --> 00:18:56,942
Eat up.

313
00:19:01,083 --> 00:19:02,583
Go take care of what you need to do.

314
00:19:03,083 --> 00:19:04,333
No, it's okay.

315
00:19:05,041 --> 00:19:06,125
Want me to step out?

316
00:19:07,375 --> 00:19:09,547
Yeah. I want to get some sleep.

317
00:19:10,208 --> 00:19:11,583
Okay. I'll be in the living room.

318
00:19:12,291 --> 00:19:13,377
Call me if you need anything.

319
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:15,720
Okay.

320
00:19:43,136 --> 00:19:46,917
Ji Ni! No...

321
00:19:57,500 --> 00:19:58,500
Yes, Mother.

322
00:19:59,886 --> 00:20:01,583
Ji Ni had some seaweed soup
and is sleeping now.

323
00:20:03,208 --> 00:20:06,193
I'm sorry I couldn't stop the car earlier.
I had no choice.

324
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,000
Me?

325
00:20:10,458 --> 00:20:14,750
To be honest, I don't really know
what to think of you, Mother.

326
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,000
That's true.

327
00:20:21,650 --> 00:20:25,100
I know it happened a long time ago,
but it still shocks me.

328
00:20:37,117 --> 00:20:38,242
I'll call you again.

329
00:20:44,583 --> 00:20:48,250
Ji Ni, it's okay. Please open the door.

330
00:20:48,958 --> 00:20:51,666
Ji Ni!

331
00:20:56,000 --> 00:20:57,125
I'm fine.

332
00:21:00,625 --> 00:21:03,416
Ji Ni, is everything okay?

333
00:21:07,333 --> 00:21:09,041
Ji Ni, are you okay?

334
00:21:14,041 --> 00:21:15,291
Please, just open the door.

335
00:21:16,458 --> 00:21:20,041
Ji Ni, are you okay?

336
00:21:26,166 --> 00:21:29,000
Ji Ni, is everything okay?

337
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,541
Sit here. Is your stomach upset?

338
00:21:45,416 --> 00:21:46,875
I'll get some medicine from Uncle.

339
00:21:49,373 --> 00:21:50,373
What?

340
00:21:50,375 --> 00:21:53,416
Please, stop worrying about me
and go about your day.

341
00:21:53,623 --> 00:21:56,833
- How can I do that?
- Just for now. Just a few days.

342
00:21:57,625 --> 00:21:59,000
Please. I'm begging you.

343
00:22:01,291 --> 00:22:04,875
Just leave me alone.

344
00:22:08,829 --> 00:22:10,954
Give me some time to sort things out.

345
00:22:38,891 --> 00:22:39,891
Wait a minute.

346
00:22:41,500 --> 00:22:45,583
Se Ri, are you feeling any better?
I'm worried about you.

347
00:22:46,682 --> 00:22:49,609
No, I can't. I shouldn't.

348
00:22:53,916 --> 00:22:55,015
Uncle.

349
00:22:55,083 --> 00:22:58,541
Ji Hu, glad you're here.

350
00:22:58,750 --> 00:23:01,166
I'm going out of my mind here.

351
00:23:01,500 --> 00:23:03,583
You know where Se Ri is
and how she's doing, right?

352
00:23:03,750 --> 00:23:05,041
Is that why you called me?

353
00:23:06,583 --> 00:23:10,041
No, this is for Ji Ni.

354
00:23:10,441 --> 00:23:12,566
It's a restorative herbal tonic
to help her recover from the miscarriage.

355
00:23:14,514 --> 00:23:15,597
But what's wrong with you?

356
00:23:16,288 --> 00:23:18,538
How will Se Ri get by
if you're like this too?

357
00:23:18,958 --> 00:23:20,759
Ji Ni can be angry, but you shouldn't be.

358
00:23:20,760 --> 00:23:22,541
Ji Ni might resent you later.

359
00:23:23,390 --> 00:23:24,916
I was thinking that too,

360
00:23:25,536 --> 00:23:27,544
but I'm genuinely disappointed
in my mother-in-law.

361
00:23:28,469 --> 00:23:30,394
How could she torment her own daughter
like this her whole life?

362
00:23:30,735 --> 00:23:33,022
Fine, she's the daughter of a mistress.
Let's say that's true.

363
00:23:34,250 --> 00:23:37,833
Ji Ni already blames herself for being
a criminal's daughter as it is.

364
00:23:38,750 --> 00:23:40,958
I was shocked to hear
about Director Cha's leg.

365
00:23:41,333 --> 00:23:43,208
She actually made her daughter
the child of a criminal.

366
00:23:44,125 --> 00:23:46,607
It's still a crime, even if the statute
of limitations has expired.

367
00:23:47,875 --> 00:23:50,295
You didn't say all that to Ji Ni, did you?

368
00:23:50,963 --> 00:23:52,005
Of course not.

369
00:23:52,931 --> 00:23:55,416
Earlier, it seemed like Ji Ni
was cutting ties with her mom,

370
00:23:55,703 --> 00:23:56,902
but I couldn't stop her.

371
00:23:58,972 --> 00:24:01,118
Maestro must've been so hurt.

372
00:24:01,625 --> 00:24:04,500
Why? What right does she have
to feel hurt?

373
00:24:04,708 --> 00:24:07,583
Is that what they call a generation gap?

374
00:24:08,746 --> 00:24:11,225
First, we have to make sure she survives.

375
00:24:11,226 --> 00:24:12,829
You can't be so hard on her.

376
00:24:12,875 --> 00:24:16,208
Even if Ji Ni won't,
you should at least look after her.

377
00:24:17,333 --> 00:24:20,319
Honestly, I just can't bring myself
to feel that way right now.

378
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:26,041
Okay. Take this with you.
What about dinner?

379
00:24:26,083 --> 00:24:27,458
Tae O and Jung A invited me out.

380
00:24:27,619 --> 00:24:31,000
Good. Go out for a bit
and clear your head.

381
00:24:32,750 --> 00:24:35,208
What about you, Uncle?
Are you going to Seo Chon?

382
00:24:35,250 --> 00:24:39,000
Of course. Where the needle goes,
the thread follows.

383
00:24:40,963 --> 00:24:44,338
A needle and thread. I'm jealous.

384
00:24:45,608 --> 00:24:47,483
I'm like a kite with a broken string.

385
00:24:49,861 --> 00:24:52,694
Hey, Ji Hu.

386
00:24:58,524 --> 00:25:00,305
This is more serious than I thought.

387
00:25:01,541 --> 00:25:02,750
Dinner with Ji Hu tonight?

388
00:25:03,899 --> 00:25:05,362
Well done, Jung A.

389
00:25:06,500 --> 00:25:08,958
Just get Tae O out of the way.

390
00:25:09,653 --> 00:25:11,255
Or get him drunk.

391
00:25:11,333 --> 00:25:14,403
Give him something really strong
so he gets completely wasted.

392
00:25:16,583 --> 00:25:17,916
Did your makeover turn out well?

393
00:25:18,833 --> 00:25:21,500
Send me a picture. Okay.

394
00:25:27,458 --> 00:25:30,833
You're so pretty.
Just like my daughter-in-law should be.

395
00:25:31,666 --> 00:25:34,958
Okay. Call me often. Yeah.

396
00:25:37,932 --> 00:25:40,640
You're close with your daughter-in-law.
I'm jealous.

397
00:25:40,791 --> 00:25:42,625
Don't even get me started.

398
00:25:43,024 --> 00:25:45,089
I have to teach her everything
from A to Z.

399
00:25:46,041 --> 00:25:47,666
Young people are all like that these days.

400
00:25:48,541 --> 00:25:52,375
Still, she's so sweet.
She listens well and acts quickly.

401
00:25:52,875 --> 00:25:54,317
You made a good choice.

402
00:25:54,500 --> 00:25:56,833
This is so convenient.
Shall I ring you up?

403
00:25:56,875 --> 00:25:57,916
Yes.

404
00:26:08,958 --> 00:26:10,083
I'll be back.

405
00:26:11,791 --> 00:26:13,458
Okay. Have a good time.

406
00:26:14,458 --> 00:26:17,465
I'll come with you next time. I'm sorry.

407
00:26:17,708 --> 00:26:18,994
I don't feel like going out.

408
00:26:19,429 --> 00:26:20,476
Can't we watch this together?

409
00:26:23,375 --> 00:26:26,125
Don't let yourself get down too.
Go on and have a good time.

410
00:26:27,127 --> 00:26:29,711
You have a lot to thank Jung A
and Tae O for.

411
00:26:30,916 --> 00:26:32,824
Treat them to a nice dinner,

412
00:26:33,330 --> 00:26:37,493
and enjoy the food yourself too.
It'll help clear your head.

413
00:26:38,171 --> 00:26:39,171
Okay?

414
00:26:40,848 --> 00:26:41,890
Okay.

415
00:27:09,981 --> 00:27:10,981
Mom.

416
00:27:11,880 --> 00:27:14,815
I just got a call from the lawyer.

417
00:27:15,158 --> 00:27:17,491
The final forensic results are in.

418
00:27:18,797 --> 00:27:21,764
It turns out Lee Cheol himself
was the one who started the fire.

419
00:27:22,125 --> 00:27:25,708
The only fingerprints found
on the lighter were Lee Cheol's.

420
00:27:26,140 --> 00:27:29,586
Your eldest son has been cleared of arson.

421
00:27:31,566 --> 00:27:34,774
Thank goodness!

422
00:27:37,791 --> 00:27:39,666
That's such a relief, Yeong Ju.

423
00:27:41,066 --> 00:27:42,176
And there's one more thing.

424
00:27:43,024 --> 00:27:44,488
Seung Hyun...

425
00:27:45,213 --> 00:27:46,868
has also been cleared of murder.

426
00:27:47,208 --> 00:27:48,518
Really?

427
00:27:52,125 --> 00:27:54,875
Mom, there's one more thing
that'll surprise you.

428
00:27:55,875 --> 00:27:56,916
What is it?

429
00:27:57,041 --> 00:27:59,750
You know the body they found there?

430
00:28:01,380 --> 00:28:04,005
It wasn't Lee Cheol.

431
00:28:06,848 --> 00:28:08,399
Then who was it?

432
00:28:09,833 --> 00:28:11,791
They say it was a woman's body.

433
00:28:12,416 --> 00:28:15,125
A woman's body?

434
00:28:40,541 --> 00:28:43,750
(Family Register)

435
00:28:43,875 --> 00:28:45,458
Just because you're the official wife,

436
00:28:45,500 --> 00:28:47,875
does that mean you can look down on
someone like me, the mistress?

437
00:28:47,877 --> 00:28:50,375
Why do I have to have someone like you
for a mother? I'm ashamed of you.

438
00:28:50,416 --> 00:28:51,833
Don't stop me from doing my duty
as her son-in-law.

439
00:28:51,875 --> 00:28:53,666
- You have a serious hero complex.
- What?

440
00:28:53,708 --> 00:28:55,833
It's hard, isn't it?
It feels like being shot.

441
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:57,165
Are you going to keep messing around?

442
00:28:57,166 --> 00:28:58,179
I like Ji Hu.

443
00:28:58,219 --> 00:29:00,144
A serial killer?
Could Maestro be in danger?

444
00:29:00,166 --> 00:29:01,708
I think he installed something
on your phone.

445
00:29:01,750 --> 00:29:03,375
So he can track my location right now too?

446
00:29:04,647 --> 00:29:06,647
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
